r directions.","hint":"would sooner \u002B ?","explanation":"would sooner \u002B bare infinitive (like would rather): sooner drive."},{"answer":"to know","accept":[],"options":["to know","to knowing","know","knowing"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He seems ___ the news already.","hint":"seem \u002B ?","explanation":"seem/appear take the to-infinitive: seems to know."}]}